    "text": "(i) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#10233;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#10233;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e19f6dc7-31eb-4a0e-a432-a0c9a9a96a60-image33.png\" /> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3.87</mn></math><br />(ii) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#10233;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/67561494-ead5-4563-8881-d06857765c46-image34.png\" /> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2.82</mn></math><br />(iii) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"