up><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt></math> B.M. Hence more the value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> more will be magnitude moment.",
